{
  "_doc": "Relevance score: a deterministic 0-100 weighted sum, no LLM. Each component is 0-1 and comes from data (taxonomy weight, source reliability, entity tier, official flag, number of distinct publishers). v1 is kept unchanged for comparison; active_version selects the one in use.",
